// A sum or difference as KIELER writes it into C, `x = c[1 - (i - 0)]`. KIELER runs it: x is 0, 7, 4.
scchart Main { input bool b input int i int a[2] = {4,7} int c[2] = {4,7} int m[2][2] = {{4,7},{8,1}} float fa[2] bool ba[2] output int x output float f output bool y initial state A do x = c[1 - (i - 0)] go to A }
